text.paragraph:
Evaluate vitamin B6 levels prior to initiating carbidopa/levodopa therapies, including carbidopa and levodopa tablets, periodically during treatment, and as clinically indicated (See WARNINGS, 
                        Vitamin B6 Deficiency and Seizures
                     ). If vitamin B6 levels are low, supplement to sufficient levels per standard of care. Patients may initiate and continue treatment with carbidopa and levodopa tablets while supplementing vitamin B6.
